---
title: "RadioSkySim — Sequência: Fluxo satellite → tracks → signal → assembled"
---
%% Pacote: radioskysims-sources (satellite/tracks/signal) (2026-09-01)
sequenceDiagram
  participant Repo as SatelliteRepository
  participant SatF as SatelliteFactory
  participant Sel as TLESelector
  participant Asm as SatelliteAssembler
  participant TrackF as TrackFactory
  participant SigF as SignalFactory
  participant Geo as GeometryProvider
  participant Sim as Simulation
  participant Result as SatelliteAssembled

  Note over SatF,Result: 1. OBTENÇÃO DOS SATÉLITES
  SatF->>Repo: load_elements(norad_ids)
  Repo-->>SatF: SatID[ ] (com TLE)
  SatF->>Sel: select(satids, epoch_jd)
  Sel-->>SatF: Satélites com TLE mais próximo
  SatF-->>SatF: Satellite(norad_id, name, element)

  Note over TrackF,Geo: 2. CÁLCULO DE TRACKS
  Asm->>TrackF: build(sat_blocks)
  TrackF->>TrackF: _compute_xyz_km_tle(tle1, tle2, tt_jd)
  TrackF-->>TrackF: Block datasets (lazy, dask)
  TrackF->>TrackF: _build_track_ds() concatena blocos
  TrackF-->>Asm: Tracks(xr.Dataset)

  Note over Geo: 3. GEOMETRIA OBSERVACIONAL
  Asm->>Geo: compute(tracks, observer)
  Geo-->>Asm: geometry(xr.Dataset: theta, range, az, el)

  Note over SigF,SigF: 4. GERAÇÃO DE SINAIS
  Asm->>SigF: build(sat_blocks)
  SigF->>SigF: _simulate_psd(modulation, fc)
  Note right of SigF: BPSK / QPSK / BOC / CBOC\n+ Welch PSD\n+ Interpolação no grid
  SigF-->>Asm: dict[int, list[SatSignal]]

  Note over Asm,Result: 5. MONTAGEM FINAL
  Asm->>Asm: _build_psd_blocks(signals, sat_ids, freq)
  Asm->>Asm: _build_signal_assembled(psd_blocks, ...)
  Asm-->>Result: SatelliteAssembled(name, tracks, signals)
